 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Passkeys
+
+Sign-in, sign-up and account settings support passkeys (WebAuthn), built on
+[SimpleWebAuthn](https://simplewebauthn.dev/):
+
+- **Sign in** (`/signin`): passkey autofill on the username field (conditional UI), a
+  "Sign in with a passkey" button, and an automatic passkey upgrade after a password
+  sign-in (conditional create, falling back to a prompt).
+- **Sign up** (`/signup`): create a passkey-only account, or use a password and get
+  offered a passkey right after.
+- **Account settings** (`/account`): list, create, rename and delete passkeys. Creating or
+  deleting a passkey requires a sign-in or reauthentication (passkey or password) within the
+  last 5 minutes. The page uses the WebAuthn Signal API to keep passkey providers in sync.
+
+Passwords are still verified by the upstream account API, now proxied through
+`/api/auth/password-*` so the server can establish a session. Passkey-only accounts reserve
+their username upstream so usernames remain unique.
+
+Passkey data is stored in a JSON file (`.data/accounts.json`). Configuration:
+
+| Variable | Default | Purpose |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `PASSKEY_RP_ID` | request hostname | WebAuthn relying party ID |
+| `PASSKEY_ORIGIN` | request origin | Expected origin for WebAuthn responses |
+| `PASSKEY_DATA_DIR` | `./.data` | Location of the account/passkey store |
+| `ACCOUNT_API_BASE` | upstream cloud function | Username/password account API |
+
+> The file store is meant for this demo app. On ephemeral hosts (e.g. Cloud Run) point
+> `PASSKEY_DATA_DIR` at persistent storage or swap `src/lib/auth/store.ts` for a database.
